*Analysis*

Business companies have 2 payment options:

* Monthly invoice - business company pays by making bank transfers based on invoices from Bolt
** this option is considered as safe. Fraud doesn’t have data about these companies and payments
* Card payments - business company add bank card to their business account. This card is used for payments



We have {{`taxify_fraud`.`user_captured_payment`}} table.

It syncs data from Payments and stores captured payments (both for users and business companies) for 3 months. This table may be used as source for requested data.

We also have {{`taxify_fraud`.`user_bad_payment`}} table, which stores {{failed}}, {{chargeback}} payments (if needed)



We have similar data for users.

